0&txt=PRIVATE&s=e881e34ad619f06df69a70206f1630b9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TRPG10392661/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1635fa8/uploads/origins/6c41fe2f-b363-4e1f-bfe9-50ceff868149?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7c3eb45e9ea53e619a77a867e2e34b5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e1635fa8/uploads/origins/6c41fe2f-b363-4e1f-bfe9-50ceff868149?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b7c3eb45e9ea53e619a77a867e2e34b5, https://si.imgix.net/e1635fa8/uploads/origins/6c41fe2f-b363-4e1f-bfe9-50ceff868149?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f30542dbe54b75440c96b323019a8ce6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e1635fa8/uploads/origins/6c41fe2f-b363-4e1f-bfe9-50ceff868149?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31e7dd9aa6e436d91ff4d31c99f817ec 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "あえん様。\nお世話になっております、られあです。\n今回も絵を描いてほしくリクエストさせていただきます\nさっそくですが依頼内容についてです\n\n【依頼内容】\n私とうちよそである花浜とリコのイラストを描いて欲しいです。\n職業がアウトローですのでそれにそった不穏な空気間でイラスを作成して欲しいです。\n出来たらでいいですが花浜がリコを抱きかかえているようなシーンがあれば幸いです、難しいようでしたら大丈夫です。\n\nもしこの依頼がお目に留まりましたら何卒よろしくお願いいします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TRPG10392661/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d37599a4/uploads/origins/f2e46913-0709-48b9-80e4-31e55b80665f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0765ec525c80aec7454db50a0d276447", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d37599a4/uploads/origins/f2e46913-0709-48b9-80e4-31e55b80665f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0765ec525c80aec7454db50a0d276447, https://si.imgix.net/d37599a4/uploads/origins/f2e46913-0709-48b9-80e4-31e55b80665f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=31546e24839b95567aa9dcc2819285e5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d37599a4/uploads/origins/f2e46913-0709-48b9-80e4-31e55b80665f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8b9b5e7588837276f4a0a7e65bedcfe0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TRPG10392661/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/da50992f/uploads/origins/ce6a3b1d-b147-4640-9be6-014d925964f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05f875e0079dca475c8a84975fac4db6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/da50992f/uploads/origins/ce6a3b1d-b147-4640-9be6-014d925964f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05f875e0079dca475c8a84975fac4db6, https://si.imgix.net/da50992f/uploads/origins/ce6a3b1d-b147-4640-9be6-014d925964f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58a3b6c690fc1a1293e02bde4f9052ee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/da50992f/uploads/origins/ce6a3b1d-b147-4640-9be6-014d925964f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4837e9b2b1c0408cfb8ae4302825eae 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "あえん様。\nお世話になっております、かあけです。\nいつも妖艶で美しいイラスト、見ています。\n少額ながら、絵を描いて欲しくリクエストさせていただきます。\n\nさっそくですが依頼内容についてです。\n【依頼内容】\n私とうちよそである朝凪博、乾蛍介のカップリング、あさいぬの絵を描いて欲しいです。\n暗く湿った陰鬱BLのような雰囲気で、構図やシチュエーションなどはお任せしたいです。\n\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RLASF6KFHsaDIFmA_QifX2WQHn4gRiVA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TRPG10392661/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6766c2ab/uploads/origins/660660e6-c35f-4d73-b5d9-203f9e59eb23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e262001d32b9f47c7ebc478e212449b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6766c2ab/uploads/origins/660660e6-c35f-4d73-b5d9-203f9e59eb23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e262001d32b9f47c7ebc478e212449b, https://si.imgix.net/6766c2ab/uploads/origins/660660e6-c35f-4d73-b5d9-203f9e59eb23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a240bb11b8d5ad806d0bb7d60fa94a4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6766c2ab/uploads/origins/660660e6-c35f-4d73-b5d9-203f9e59eb23?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cfbba35bd59f2bc702be73678c05cb7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "It has been a long time, my name is Terulette.\n I have been looking forward to seeing your illustrations again, so I have made a request again.\nI am still new to Skeb, so the wording is not quite right, for which I apologize.\nIf there are any flaws or rudeness, please feel free to ignore them.\n\nRequest\nThe illustration I would like to request this time is of the explorers I took to the CoC \"Overrun by My Hand\".\nI would appreciate it if you could draw them playing chess with each other holding a piece and a wry smile on their faces.\n\nI would like to use it for my personal appreciation.\n\n\nCharacter Details\nPerson 1: Political Leader\nName: Levitsky Sokolov\nAge: 29\nHeight: 189 cm\nExternal features: Green hair, red eyes, slitted eyes, eye patch on the left, jagged teeth\n\nSecond person: Chief of General Staff\nName: Hirofumi Huang\nAge: 24\nHeight: 170cm\nAppearance: Black hair, black eyes, long braids, monocle, no double teeth, left leg prosthesis\n\n\nRelationships.\nWar criminals who are responsible for each other's war in a big war.\n\nIf you accept my request...\nIf you accept my request, I will not spoil it, but there is a possibility that some people may think it is a spoiler! I would appreciate it if you would not post the finished work on X (formerly known as Twitter). We apologize for our selfishness.\n\nThat's all for the details. Last but not least, if this request catches your attention, we would appreciate it very much.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TRPG10392661/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9de789d7/uploads/origins/e3cf909e-6223-4076-8eb4-15f58c7e879a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5c2ecedb9d762810d4444013c5dbf69", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9de789d7/uploads/origins/e3cf909e-6223-4076-8eb4-15f58c7e879a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5c2ecedb9d762810d4444013c5dbf69, https://si.imgix.net/9de789d7/uploads/origins/e3cf909e-6223-4076-8eb4-15f58c7e879a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b1e50e9d518680f2715702dfc86043d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9de789d7/uploads/origins/e3cf909e-6223-4076-8eb4-15f58c7e879a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e26edb7b27d9772e4f55ab51d005a646 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "It has been a long time, my name is Terutarego.\n\nI have been looking forward to seeing your illustrations again, so I have made a request again.\nI am still new to Skeb, so the wording is not quite right, for which I apologize.\nIf there are any flaws or rudeness, please feel free to ignore them.\n\nRequest\nThe illustration I would like to request is of the explorers I took to the CoC \"Kurashi Recital\".\nI would appreciate it if you could depict such a happy space where the polarities are feeding oranges to the rakugo storytellers while they are in the kotatsu.\n\nI would like to use it for my personal appreciation.\n\nCharacter Details\nThe first person: A polemicist\nName: Kuga Anji\nAge: 26\nHeight: 184m\nExternal Characteristics: Short black hair, reddish-pink eyes, dark eyes, no double teeth, black kimono\nInternal Characteristics: Basically, he thinks nothing of it, but he is deeply in love with his partner, a rakugo storyteller, and will actively do things for him.\n\nSecond person: Rakugo storyteller\nName: Sanjo Fuuga\nAge: 26\nHeight: 174 cm\nExternal Characteristics: Brown hair, tied in a single knot at the lower back, string eyes (can be opened), no double teeth, round glasses\nInternal Characteristics: Moves to be well received by others. He is affectionate toward the polemicist, but becomes what is called a tsundere.\n\n[Relationships.\nThe rakugo storyteller and the Kyokudojin originally had a dog-and-monkey relationship, but now the Kyokudojin has married the rakugo storyteller and they are in love with each other.\nThey are completely unresponsive to the rakugo storyteller's indirect aggression (they are just unaware of it).\nThe relationship may seem distorted to those around them, but they are connected by pure love.\n\nIf you accept our request\nIf you accept my request, I will not spoil the story, but there is a possibility that someone may think it is a spoiler! I would appreciate it if you would not post the finished work on X (formerly known as Twitter). We apologize for our selfishness.\n\nThat's all for the details.\nLastly, if this request catches your attention, we would appreciate it very much.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TRPG10392661/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/987bb0a9/uploads/origins/471a80d5-5d61-4d71-8b6d-ba1fff4808d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cec8f5ae93a7391d49036a43071d0dcc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/987bb0a9/uploads/origins/471a80d5-5d61-4d71-8b6d-ba1fff4808d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cec8f5ae93a7391d49036a43071d0dcc, https://si.imgix.net/987bb0a9/uploads/origins/471a80d5-5d61-4d71-8b6d-ba1fff4808d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2758abfcc63c00f7a00e7e99e909d